These are the easiest to integrate live because they offer open JSON/CSV endpoints or simple API keys.

NASA FIRMS (Wildfires & Thermal Anomalies)

Link: https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/api/

Format: CSV via REST API

USGS (Earthquakes)

Link: https://earthquake.usgs.gov/earthquakes/feed/v1.0/geojson.php

Format: Open GeoJSON (No key required)

OpenWeatherMap (Severe Weather, Floods, Cyclones)

Link: https://openweathermap.org/api/one-call-3#alerts

Format: JSON (Requires free API key)

GDACS - Global Disaster Alert System (Multi-Hazard)

Link: https://www.gdacs.org/xml/

Format: GeoJSON and RSS XML (Covers quakes, tsunamis, floods, cyclones)
